Cloze via spinner, then back out, then reopen.\n\nWait, but the last time we backed out, the spinner was set to Basic (observed after reopen). So no persistence. Maybe the \"stored straight away\" refers to collection but the Add screen defaults to Basic because... Hmm.\n\nLet me test with switching to Cloze and back out carefully."}
