ats.\n\nBut note: the \"Today\" section for Spanish says Studied 4 cards etc. Let me check collection stats to see aggregate (7 or 8 reviews?). Good consistency test.\n\nAlso need to test \"Save PDF\" maybe; not necessary.\n\nLet me tap the deck selector dropdown (arrow at top right, element? Earlier \"TextView Spanish id=deck_name\" clickable). Then choose collection radio? There's also a \"collection\" radio in the toolbar. Let me select \"collection\" radio and check stats update: today total 4 reviews (same), card counts total 8 (5 Spanish + 3 French). Let me do that."}
