urrently: header French, search deck:\"French\", radio deck. Let me tap collection first (clears), then pick French again? Wait, we're already in French. Sequence:\n- Tap collection → search empty, data collection.\n- Tap title French → select French → search deck:\"French\", radio collection stays.\n- Tap deck radio → search deck:current, data Spanish, header French.\nLet me execute."}
